<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Players said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Players said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded Players International Inc to neutral from outperform, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- cut the earnings estimate to $0.27 per share from $0.35 for fiscal 1997, ending in March, and to $0.37 from $0.68 for 1998, the source said.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/4 to six.</p>
</text>
